{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaceship Tycoon game set in the wild west of space.\u00a0 A trading, crafting, and business simulation in space. Build up colonies and set up new mining ventures to extract foreign untapped resources from many celestial bodies. A sandbox game that is procedurally generated with a seed. The player sets up space stations, factories, mining operations, and is also responsible for the transportation of goods and commodities. Explore different planets, suns, and blackholes.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Demo Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demo includes the first map of the campaign. All transport ships are available. All factories are available. All product types are available. The full game will include all campaign missions and a fully customizable sandbox with different planets, suns, blackholes, and missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build Factories and Mining Outposts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061290/extras/11bbc600981969a7f329551e5d4f9037.poster.avif?t=1759006012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061290/extras/11bbc600981969a7f329551e5d4f9037.webm?t=1759006012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061290/extras/11bbc600981969a7f329551e5d4f9037.mp4?t=1759006012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build factories and set up mining outposts to transfer resources and products for profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Establish Shipping Lanes and Routes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061290/extras/f686e1ca5a0385c6d31039059b19a07b.poster.avif?t=1759006012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061290/extras/f686e1ca5a0385c6d31039059b19a07b.webm?t=1759006012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061290/extras/f686e1ca5a0385c6d31039059b19a07b.mp4?t=1759006012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish routes from mining operations to factories and from factories to cities all in 3D space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build Ships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061290/extras/3e204d544600e0834bcd000f52adab9c.poster.avif?t=1759006012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061290/extras/3e204d544600e0834bcd000f52adab9c.webm?t=1759006012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061290/extras/3e204d544600e0834bcd000f52adab9c.mp4?t=1759006012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build ships to carry your resources from your mining operation, to the factories, and finally arriving at the cities for profit. All in classic transportation tycoon style.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4061290?t=1759006012","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4061290?t=1759006012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as